      "content": "That's a much better angle. If we call it a \"data staging\" process for an upgrade, it's basically impossible for them to argue we were being negligent. \n\nOne thing though—if anyone asks why the \"staging\" happened in an unencrypted bucket specifically, how do we answer that without admitting it was a mistake? Is there a way to make the specific technical setup sound like it was an intentional choice for the migration speed or something?",
